{"id": "UgzCz8P7f7CbR3PUWhZ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "Same old view, same old room all day long trapped inside my phone \nEveryone’s running , matching the peace \nBut im just stuck in this quiet space \nLingering shadows by my bed \nThe heavy thoughts inside my head \nBut the morning light breaks on through\nTurning the page , making it new\nYesterday is gone , tomorrow is too far \nWe are right here , exactly where we are \nDon’t let this moment drift away \nNo happy ending needed , just live today\n\nA little clumsy , maybe the same \nBut every morning has a different name \nPast stains and  future fears\nLeave them all behind as the sky clears\nA brand new start right here \nDrop the regrets that held you tight \nThey don’t belong in this beautiful light\nYou don’t have carry it all alone \nOpen the door \nStep into the unknown \nYesterday is gone , tomorrow is too far \nWe are right here , exactly where we are \nDon’t let this moment drift away \nNo happy ending needed , just live today\nLeave it all behind \nwe are right here , exactly where we are \n\njust today .lyrics", "published": "2026-09-03T08:53:44", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
